1683:.sdk/SR5E1_MCTK-1.3.0/include/LL_Library/sr5e1_ll_adc.h ****   *         LL_ADC_CHANNEL_TEMPSENSOR, ...),
1684:.sdk/SR5E1_MCTK-1.3.0/include/LL_Library/sr5e1_ll_adc.h ****   *         to its equivalent parameter definition of a ADC external channel
1685:.sdk/SR5E1_MCTK-1.3.0/include/LL_Library/sr5e1_ll_adc.h ****   *         (LL_ADC_CHANNEL_1, LL_ADC_CHANNEL_2, ...).
1686:.sdk/SR5E1_MCTK-1.3.0/include/LL_Library/sr5e1_ll_adc.h ****   * @note   The channel parameter can be, additionally to a value
1687:.sdk/SR5E1_MCTK-1.3.0/include/LL_Library/sr5e1_ll_adc.h ****   *         defined from parameter definition of a ADC internal channel
1688:.sdk/SR5E1_MCTK-1.3.0/include/LL_Library/sr5e1_ll_adc.h ****   *         (LL_ADC_CHANNEL_VREFINT, LL_ADC_CHANNEL_TEMPSENSOR, ...),
1689:.sdk/SR5E1_MCTK-1.3.0/include/LL_Library/sr5e1_ll_adc.h ****   *         a value defined from parameter definition of
1690:.sdk/SR5E1_MCTK-1.3.0/include/LL_Library/sr5e1_ll_adc.h ****   *         ADC external channel (LL_ADC_CHANNEL_1, LL_ADC_CHANNEL_2, ...)
