1849:.sdk/SR5E1_MCTK-1.3.0/include/LL_Library/sr5e1_ll_adc.h ****   *         (1) On SR5E1, parameter available only on ADC instances: ADC1, ADC5.\n
1850:.sdk/SR5E1_MCTK-1.3.0/include/LL_Library/sr5e1_ll_adc.h ****   *         (2) On SR5E1, parameter available only on ADC instances: ADC2, ADC4.\n
1851:.sdk/SR5E1_MCTK-1.3.0/include/LL_Library/sr5e1_ll_adc.h ****   *         (3) On SR5E1, fast channel allows: 2.5 (sampling) + 12.5 (conversion) = 15 ADC clock cy
1852:.sdk/SR5E1_MCTK-1.3.0/include/LL_Library/sr5e1_ll_adc.h ****   *             Other channels are slow channels  allows: 6.5 (sampling) + 12.5 (conversion) = 19 A
