5812:.sdk/SR5E1_MCTK-1.3.0/include/LL_Library/sr5e1_ll_adc.h ****   * @brief  Get ADC oversampling ratio
5813:.sdk/SR5E1_MCTK-1.3.0/include/LL_Library/sr5e1_ll_adc.h ****   *        (impacting both ADC groups regular and injected)
5814:.sdk/SR5E1_MCTK-1.3.0/include/LL_Library/sr5e1_ll_adc.h ****   * @rmtoll CFGR2    OVSR           LL_ADC_GetOverSamplingRatio
5815:.sdk/SR5E1_MCTK-1.3.0/include/LL_Library/sr5e1_ll_adc.h ****   * @param  ADCx ADC instance
5816:.sdk/SR5E1_MCTK-1.3.0/include/LL_Library/sr5e1_ll_adc.h ****   * @retval Ratio This parameter can be one of the following values:
