  11:.sdk/SR5E1_MCTK-1.3.0/src/MotorControl/regular_conversion_manager.c **** /**
  12:.sdk/SR5E1_MCTK-1.3.0/src/MotorControl/regular_conversion_manager.c **** *   @file    regular_conversion_manager.c
  13:.sdk/SR5E1_MCTK-1.3.0/src/MotorControl/regular_conversion_manager.c **** *   @version M4_VERSION
  14:.sdk/SR5E1_MCTK-1.3.0/src/MotorControl/regular_conversion_manager.c **** *   @brief   This file provides firmware functions that implement the features
  15:.sdk/SR5E1_MCTK-1.3.0/src/MotorControl/regular_conversion_manager.c **** *            of the regular_conversion_manager component of the Stellar Motor Control.
  16:.sdk/SR5E1_MCTK-1.3.0/src/MotorControl/regular_conversion_manager.c **** *
  17:.sdk/SR5E1_MCTK-1.3.0/src/MotorControl/regular_conversion_manager.c **** *   @details This file provides firmware functions that implement the features
  18:.sdk/SR5E1_MCTK-1.3.0/src/MotorControl/regular_conversion_manager.c **** *            of the regular_conversion_manager component of the Stellar Motor Control:
  19:.sdk/SR5E1_MCTK-1.3.0/src/MotorControl/regular_conversion_manager.c **** *
  20:.sdk/SR5E1_MCTK-1.3.0/src/MotorControl/regular_conversion_manager.c **** *            - Register conversion with or without callback
  21:.sdk/SR5E1_MCTK-1.3.0/src/MotorControl/regular_conversion_manager.c **** *            - Execute regular conv directly from Temperature and VBus sensors
  22:.sdk/SR5E1_MCTK-1.3.0/src/MotorControl/regular_conversion_manager.c **** *            - Execute user regular conversion scheduled by medium frequency task
  23:.sdk/SR5E1_MCTK-1.3.0/src/MotorControl/regular_conversion_manager.c **** *            - Manage user conversion state machine
  24:.sdk/SR5E1_MCTK-1.3.0/src/MotorControl/regular_conversion_manager.c **** *
  25:.sdk/SR5E1_MCTK-1.3.0/src/MotorControl/regular_conversion_manager.c ****  */
  26:.sdk/SR5E1_MCTK-1.3.0/src/MotorControl/regular_conversion_manager.c **** 
  27:.sdk/SR5E1_MCTK-1.3.0/src/MotorControl/regular_conversion_manager.c **** /* Includes ------------------------------------------------------------------*/
  28:.sdk/SR5E1_MCTK-1.3.0/src/MotorControl/regular_conversion_manager.c **** #include "regular_conversion_manager.h"
  29:.sdk/SR5E1_MCTK-1.3.0/src/MotorControl/regular_conversion_manager.c **** #include "mc_config.h"
  30:.sdk/SR5E1_MCTK-1.3.0/src/MotorControl/regular_conversion_manager.c **** 
  31:.sdk/SR5E1_MCTK-1.3.0/src/MotorControl/regular_conversion_manager.c **** /** @addtogroup STELLAR_PMSM_MC_FOC_LIBRARY
  32:.sdk/SR5E1_MCTK-1.3.0/src/MotorControl/regular_conversion_manager.c ****   * @{
  33:.sdk/SR5E1_MCTK-1.3.0/src/MotorControl/regular_conversion_manager.c ****   */
  34:.sdk/SR5E1_MCTK-1.3.0/src/MotorControl/regular_conversion_manager.c **** 
  35:.sdk/SR5E1_MCTK-1.3.0/src/MotorControl/regular_conversion_manager.c **** /** @defgroup RCM Regular Conversion Manager
  36:.sdk/SR5E1_MCTK-1.3.0/src/MotorControl/regular_conversion_manager.c ****   * @brief Regular Conversion Manager component of the Stellar Motor Control
  37:.sdk/SR5E1_MCTK-1.3.0/src/MotorControl/regular_conversion_manager.c ****   *
  38:.sdk/SR5E1_MCTK-1.3.0/src/MotorControl/regular_conversion_manager.c ****   * MotorControl SDK makes an extensive usage of ADCs. Some conversions are timing critical
  39:.sdk/SR5E1_MCTK-1.3.0/src/MotorControl/regular_conversion_manager.c ****   * like current reading, and some have less constraints. If an ADC offers both Injected and Regula
  40:.sdk/SR5E1_MCTK-1.3.0/src/MotorControl/regular_conversion_manager.c ****   * channels, critical conversions will be systematically done on Injected channels, because they
  41:.sdk/SR5E1_MCTK-1.3.0/src/MotorControl/regular_conversion_manager.c ****   * interrupt any ongoing regular conversion so as to be executed without delay.
  42:.sdk/SR5E1_MCTK-1.3.0/src/MotorControl/regular_conversion_manager.c ****   * Others conversions, mainly Bus voltage, and Temperature sensing are performed with regular chan
  43:.sdk/SR5E1_MCTK-1.3.0/src/MotorControl/regular_conversion_manager.c ****   * If users wants to perform ADC conversions with an ADC already used by MC SDK, they must use reg
  44:.sdk/SR5E1_MCTK-1.3.0/src/MotorControl/regular_conversion_manager.c ****   * conversions. It is forbidden to use Injected channel on an ADC that is already in use for curre
  45:.sdk/SR5E1_MCTK-1.3.0/src/MotorControl/regular_conversion_manager.c ****   * As usera and MC-SDK may share ADC regular scheduler, this component intents to manage all the
  46:.sdk/SR5E1_MCTK-1.3.0/src/MotorControl/regular_conversion_manager.c ****   * regular conversions.
  47:.sdk/SR5E1_MCTK-1.3.0/src/MotorControl/regular_conversion_manager.c ****   *
  48:.sdk/SR5E1_MCTK-1.3.0/src/MotorControl/regular_conversion_manager.c ****   * If users wants to execute their own conversion, they first have to register it through the
  49:.sdk/SR5E1_MCTK-1.3.0/src/MotorControl/regular_conversion_manager.c ****   * RCM_RegisterRegConv_WithCB() or RCM_RegisterRegConv() APIs. Multiple conversions can be registe
  50:.sdk/SR5E1_MCTK-1.3.0/src/MotorControl/regular_conversion_manager.c ****   * but only one can be scheduled at a time .
  51:.sdk/SR5E1_MCTK-1.3.0/src/MotorControl/regular_conversion_manager.c ****   *
  52:.sdk/SR5E1_MCTK-1.3.0/src/MotorControl/regular_conversion_manager.c ****   * A requested user regular conversion will be executed by the medium frequency task after the
  53:.sdk/SR5E1_MCTK-1.3.0/src/MotorControl/regular_conversion_manager.c ****   * MC-SDK regular safety conversions: Bus voltage and Temperature.
  54:.sdk/SR5E1_MCTK-1.3.0/src/MotorControl/regular_conversion_manager.c ****   *
  55:.sdk/SR5E1_MCTK-1.3.0/src/MotorControl/regular_conversion_manager.c ****   * If a callback is registered, particular care must be taken with the code executed inside the CB
  56:.sdk/SR5E1_MCTK-1.3.0/src/MotorControl/regular_conversion_manager.c ****   * The callback code is executed under Medium frequency task IRQ context (Systick).
  57:.sdk/SR5E1_MCTK-1.3.0/src/MotorControl/regular_conversion_manager.c ****   *
  58:.sdk/SR5E1_MCTK-1.3.0/src/MotorControl/regular_conversion_manager.c ****   * If the Users do not register a callback, they must poll the RCM state machine to know if
  59:.sdk/SR5E1_MCTK-1.3.0/src/MotorControl/regular_conversion_manager.c ****   * a conversion is ready to be read, scheduled, or free to be scheduled. This is performed through
  60:.sdk/SR5E1_MCTK-1.3.0/src/MotorControl/regular_conversion_manager.c ****   * the RCM_GetUserConvState() API.
  61:.sdk/SR5E1_MCTK-1.3.0/src/MotorControl/regular_conversion_manager.c ****   *
  62:.sdk/SR5E1_MCTK-1.3.0/src/MotorControl/regular_conversion_manager.c ****   * If the state is RCM_USERCONV_IDLE, a conversion is ready to be scheduled.
  63:.sdk/SR5E1_MCTK-1.3.0/src/MotorControl/regular_conversion_manager.c ****   * if a conversion is already scheduled, the returned value is RCM_USERCONV_REQUESTED.
  64:.sdk/SR5E1_MCTK-1.3.0/src/MotorControl/regular_conversion_manager.c ****   * if a conversion is ready to be read, the returned value is RCM_USERCONV_EOC.
  65:.sdk/SR5E1_MCTK-1.3.0/src/MotorControl/regular_conversion_manager.c ****   * In RCM_USERCONV_EOC state, a call to RCM_GetUserConv will consume the value, and set the state 
  66:.sdk/SR5E1_MCTK-1.3.0/src/MotorControl/regular_conversion_manager.c ****   * to RCM_USERCONV_IDLE state. It implies that a second call without new conversion performed,
  67:.sdk/SR5E1_MCTK-1.3.0/src/MotorControl/regular_conversion_manager.c ****   * will send back 0xffff which is an error value meaning that the data is not available.
  68:.sdk/SR5E1_MCTK-1.3.0/src/MotorControl/regular_conversion_manager.c ****   * If a conversion request is executed, but the previous conversion has not been completed, nor co
  69:.sdk/SR5E1_MCTK-1.3.0/src/MotorControl/regular_conversion_manager.c ****   * the request is discarded and the RCM_RequestUserConv return false.
  70:.sdk/SR5E1_MCTK-1.3.0/src/MotorControl/regular_conversion_manager.c ****   *
  71:.sdk/SR5E1_MCTK-1.3.0/src/MotorControl/regular_conversion_manager.c ****   * If a callback is registered, the data read is sent back to the callback parameters, and therefo
  72:.sdk/SR5E1_MCTK-1.3.0/src/MotorControl/regular_conversion_manager.c ****   * @{
  73:.sdk/SR5E1_MCTK-1.3.0/src/MotorControl/regular_conversion_manager.c ****   */
  74:.sdk/SR5E1_MCTK-1.3.0/src/MotorControl/regular_conversion_manager.c **** 
