 130:.sdk/SR5E1_MCTK-1.3.0/src/MotorControl/regular_conversion_manager.c **** 
 131:.sdk/SR5E1_MCTK-1.3.0/src/MotorControl/regular_conversion_manager.c **** /* Private functions ---------------------------------------------------------*/
 132:.sdk/SR5E1_MCTK-1.3.0/src/MotorControl/regular_conversion_manager.c **** 
 133:.sdk/SR5E1_MCTK-1.3.0/src/MotorControl/regular_conversion_manager.c **** /**
 134:.sdk/SR5E1_MCTK-1.3.0/src/MotorControl/regular_conversion_manager.c ****   * @brief  Registers a regular conversion, and attaches a callback.
 135:.sdk/SR5E1_MCTK-1.3.0/src/MotorControl/regular_conversion_manager.c ****   *
 136:.sdk/SR5E1_MCTK-1.3.0/src/MotorControl/regular_conversion_manager.c ****   * This function registers a regular ADC conversion that can be later scheduled for execution. It
 137:.sdk/SR5E1_MCTK-1.3.0/src/MotorControl/regular_conversion_manager.c ****   * returns a handle that uniquely identifies the conversion. This handle is used in the other API
 138:.sdk/SR5E1_MCTK-1.3.0/src/MotorControl/regular_conversion_manager.c ****   * of the Regular Converion Manager to reference the registered conversion.
 139:.sdk/SR5E1_MCTK-1.3.0/src/MotorControl/regular_conversion_manager.c ****   *
 140:.sdk/SR5E1_MCTK-1.3.0/src/MotorControl/regular_conversion_manager.c ****   * A regular conversion is defined by an ADC + ADC channel pair. If a registration already exists
 141:.sdk/SR5E1_MCTK-1.3.0/src/MotorControl/regular_conversion_manager.c ****   * for the requested ADC + ADC channel pair, the same handle will be reused.
 142:.sdk/SR5E1_MCTK-1.3.0/src/MotorControl/regular_conversion_manager.c ****   *
 143:.sdk/SR5E1_MCTK-1.3.0/src/MotorControl/regular_conversion_manager.c ****   * The regular conversion is registered along with a callback that is executed each time the
 144:.sdk/SR5E1_MCTK-1.3.0/src/MotorControl/regular_conversion_manager.c ****   * conversion has completed. The callback is invoked with two parameters:
 145:.sdk/SR5E1_MCTK-1.3.0/src/MotorControl/regular_conversion_manager.c ****   *
 146:.sdk/SR5E1_MCTK-1.3.0/src/MotorControl/regular_conversion_manager.c ****   * - the handle of the regular conversion
 147:.sdk/SR5E1_MCTK-1.3.0/src/MotorControl/regular_conversion_manager.c ****   * - a data pointer, supplied by uthe users at registration time.
 148:.sdk/SR5E1_MCTK-1.3.0/src/MotorControl/regular_conversion_manager.c ****   *
 149:.sdk/SR5E1_MCTK-1.3.0/src/MotorControl/regular_conversion_manager.c ****   * The registration may fail if there is no space left for additional conversions. The
 150:.sdk/SR5E1_MCTK-1.3.0/src/MotorControl/regular_conversion_manager.c ****   * maximum number of regular conversion that can be registered is defined by #RCM_MAX_CONV.
 151:.sdk/SR5E1_MCTK-1.3.0/src/MotorControl/regular_conversion_manager.c ****   *
 152:.sdk/SR5E1_MCTK-1.3.0/src/MotorControl/regular_conversion_manager.c ****   * @note   Users who do not want a callback to be executed at the end of the conversion,
 153:.sdk/SR5E1_MCTK-1.3.0/src/MotorControl/regular_conversion_manager.c ****   *         should use RCM_RegisterRegConv() instead.
 154:.sdk/SR5E1_MCTK-1.3.0/src/MotorControl/regular_conversion_manager.c ****   *
 155:.sdk/SR5E1_MCTK-1.3.0/src/MotorControl/regular_conversion_manager.c ****   * @param  regConv Pointer to the regular conversion parameters.
 156:.sdk/SR5E1_MCTK-1.3.0/src/MotorControl/regular_conversion_manager.c ****   *         Contains ADC, Channel and sampling time to be used.
 157:.sdk/SR5E1_MCTK-1.3.0/src/MotorControl/regular_conversion_manager.c ****   *
 158:.sdk/SR5E1_MCTK-1.3.0/src/MotorControl/regular_conversion_manager.c ****   * @param  fctCB Function called once the regular conversion is executed.
 159:.sdk/SR5E1_MCTK-1.3.0/src/MotorControl/regular_conversion_manager.c ****   *
 160:.sdk/SR5E1_MCTK-1.3.0/src/MotorControl/regular_conversion_manager.c ****   * @param  data Used to save a user context. this parameter will be send back by
 161:.sdk/SR5E1_MCTK-1.3.0/src/MotorControl/regular_conversion_manager.c ****   *               the fctCB function. @b Note: This parameter can be NULL if not used.
 162:.sdk/SR5E1_MCTK-1.3.0/src/MotorControl/regular_conversion_manager.c ****   *
 163:.sdk/SR5E1_MCTK-1.3.0/src/MotorControl/regular_conversion_manager.c ****   *  @retval the handle of the registered conversion or 255 if the registration failed
 164:.sdk/SR5E1_MCTK-1.3.0/src/MotorControl/regular_conversion_manager.c ****   */
 165:.sdk/SR5E1_MCTK-1.3.0/src/MotorControl/regular_conversion_manager.c **** uint8_t RCM_RegisterRegConv_WithCB (RegConv_t * regConv, RCM_exec_cb_t fctCB, void *data)
