 178:.sdk/SR5E1_MCTK-1.3.0/src/MotorControl/regular_conversion_manager.c ****   * @brief  Registers a regular conversion.
 179:.sdk/SR5E1_MCTK-1.3.0/src/MotorControl/regular_conversion_manager.c ****   *
 180:.sdk/SR5E1_MCTK-1.3.0/src/MotorControl/regular_conversion_manager.c ****   * This function registers a regular ADC conversion that can be later scheduled for execution. It
 181:.sdk/SR5E1_MCTK-1.3.0/src/MotorControl/regular_conversion_manager.c ****   * returns a handle that uniquely identifies the conversion. This handle is used in the other API
 182:.sdk/SR5E1_MCTK-1.3.0/src/MotorControl/regular_conversion_manager.c ****   * of the Regular Converion Manager to reference the registered conversion.
 183:.sdk/SR5E1_MCTK-1.3.0/src/MotorControl/regular_conversion_manager.c ****   *
 184:.sdk/SR5E1_MCTK-1.3.0/src/MotorControl/regular_conversion_manager.c ****   * A regular conversion is defined by an ADC + ADC channel pair. If a registration already exists
