 188:.sdk/SR5E1_MCTK-1.3.0/src/MotorControl/regular_conversion_manager.c ****   * maximum number of regular conversion that can be registered is defined by #RCM_MAX_CONV.
 189:.sdk/SR5E1_MCTK-1.3.0/src/MotorControl/regular_conversion_manager.c ****   *
