 192:.sdk/SR5E1_MCTK-1.3.0/src/MotorControl/regular_conversion_manager.c ****   *
 193:.sdk/SR5E1_MCTK-1.3.0/src/MotorControl/regular_conversion_manager.c ****   * @param  regConv Pointer to the regular conversion parameters.
 194:.sdk/SR5E1_MCTK-1.3.0/src/MotorControl/regular_conversion_manager.c ****   *         Contains ADC, Channel and sampling time to be used.
