 267:.sdk/SR5E1_MCTK-1.3.0/src/MotorControl/regular_conversion_manager.c **** /*
 268:.sdk/SR5E1_MCTK-1.3.0/src/MotorControl/regular_conversion_manager.c ****  * This function is used to read the result of a regular conversion.
 269:.sdk/SR5E1_MCTK-1.3.0/src/MotorControl/regular_conversion_manager.c ****  * Depending of the MC state machine, this function can poll on the ADC end of conversion or not.
 270:.sdk/SR5E1_MCTK-1.3.0/src/MotorControl/regular_conversion_manager.c ****  * If the ADC is already in use for currents sensing, the regular conversion can not
 271:.sdk/SR5E1_MCTK-1.3.0/src/MotorControl/regular_conversion_manager.c ****  * be executed instantaneously but have to be scheduled in order to be executed after currents sens
 272:.sdk/SR5E1_MCTK-1.3.0/src/MotorControl/regular_conversion_manager.c ****  * inside HF task.
 273:.sdk/SR5E1_MCTK-1.3.0/src/MotorControl/regular_conversion_manager.c ****  * This function takes care of inserting the handle into the scheduler.
 274:.sdk/SR5E1_MCTK-1.3.0/src/MotorControl/regular_conversion_manager.c ****  * If it is possible to execute the conversion instantaneously, it will be executed, and result ret
 275:.sdk/SR5E1_MCTK-1.3.0/src/MotorControl/regular_conversion_manager.c ****  * Otherwise, the latest stored conversion result will be returned.
 276:.sdk/SR5E1_MCTK-1.3.0/src/MotorControl/regular_conversion_manager.c ****  *
 277:.sdk/SR5E1_MCTK-1.3.0/src/MotorControl/regular_conversion_manager.c ****  * NOTE: This function is not part of the public API and users should not call it.
 278:.sdk/SR5E1_MCTK-1.3.0/src/MotorControl/regular_conversion_manager.c ****  */
