 371:.sdk/SR5E1_MCTK-1.3.0/src/MotorControl/regular_conversion_manager.c **** 
 372:.sdk/SR5E1_MCTK-1.3.0/src/MotorControl/regular_conversion_manager.c **** /**
 373:.sdk/SR5E1_MCTK-1.3.0/src/MotorControl/regular_conversion_manager.c ****  * @brief Schedules a regular conversion for execution.
 374:.sdk/SR5E1_MCTK-1.3.0/src/MotorControl/regular_conversion_manager.c ****  *
 375:.sdk/SR5E1_MCTK-1.3.0/src/MotorControl/regular_conversion_manager.c ****  * This function requests the execution of the user-defined regular conversion identified
 376:.sdk/SR5E1_MCTK-1.3.0/src/MotorControl/regular_conversion_manager.c ****  * by @p handle. All user defined conversion requests must be performed inside routines with the
 377:.sdk/SR5E1_MCTK-1.3.0/src/MotorControl/regular_conversion_manager.c ****  * same priority level. If a previous regular conversion request is pending this function has no
 378:.sdk/SR5E1_MCTK-1.3.0/src/MotorControl/regular_conversion_manager.c ****  * effect, for this reason is better to call RCM_GetUserConvState() and check if the state is
 379:.sdk/SR5E1_MCTK-1.3.0/src/MotorControl/regular_conversion_manager.c ****  * #RCM_USERCONV_IDLE before calling RCM_RequestUserConv().
 380:.sdk/SR5E1_MCTK-1.3.0/src/MotorControl/regular_conversion_manager.c ****  *
 381:.sdk/SR5E1_MCTK-1.3.0/src/MotorControl/regular_conversion_manager.c ****  * @param  handle used for the user conversion.
 382:.sdk/SR5E1_MCTK-1.3.0/src/MotorControl/regular_conversion_manager.c ****  *
 383:.sdk/SR5E1_MCTK-1.3.0/src/MotorControl/regular_conversion_manager.c ****  * @return true if the regular conversion could be scheduled and false otherwise.
