 444:.sdk/SR5E1_MCTK-1.3.0/src/MotorControl/regular_conversion_manager.c **** /**
 445:.sdk/SR5E1_MCTK-1.3.0/src/MotorControl/regular_conversion_manager.c ****  * @brief  Returns the status of the last requested regular conversion.
 446:.sdk/SR5E1_MCTK-1.3.0/src/MotorControl/regular_conversion_manager.c ****  *
 447:.sdk/SR5E1_MCTK-1.3.0/src/MotorControl/regular_conversion_manager.c ****  * It can be one of the following values:
 448:.sdk/SR5E1_MCTK-1.3.0/src/MotorControl/regular_conversion_manager.c **** 
 449:.sdk/SR5E1_MCTK-1.3.0/src/MotorControl/regular_conversion_manager.c ****  * - UDRC_STATE_IDLE no regular conversion request pending.
 450:.sdk/SR5E1_MCTK-1.3.0/src/MotorControl/regular_conversion_manager.c ****  * - UDRC_STATE_REQUESTED regular conversion has been requested and not completed.
 451:.sdk/SR5E1_MCTK-1.3.0/src/MotorControl/regular_conversion_manager.c ****  * - UDRC_STATE_EOC regular conversion has been completed but not readed from the user.
 452:.sdk/SR5E1_MCTK-1.3.0/src/MotorControl/regular_conversion_manager.c ****  *
 453:.sdk/SR5E1_MCTK-1.3.0/src/MotorControl/regular_conversion_manager.c ****  * @retval The state of the last user-defined regular conversion.
 454:.sdk/SR5E1_MCTK-1.3.0/src/MotorControl/regular_conversion_manager.c ****  */
