 460:.sdk/SR5E1_MCTK-1.3.0/src/MotorControl/regular_conversion_manager.c **** /**
 461:.sdk/SR5E1_MCTK-1.3.0/src/MotorControl/regular_conversion_manager.c ****  * @brief  Un-schedules a regular conversion
 462:.sdk/SR5E1_MCTK-1.3.0/src/MotorControl/regular_conversion_manager.c ****  *
 463:.sdk/SR5E1_MCTK-1.3.0/src/MotorControl/regular_conversion_manager.c ****  * This function does not poll ADC read and is meant to be used when
 464:.sdk/SR5E1_MCTK-1.3.0/src/MotorControl/regular_conversion_manager.c ****  * ADCs do not support injected channels.
 465:.sdk/SR5E1_MCTK-1.3.0/src/MotorControl/regular_conversion_manager.c ****  *
 466:.sdk/SR5E1_MCTK-1.3.0/src/MotorControl/regular_conversion_manager.c ****  * In such configurations, once a regular conversion has been executed once,
 467:.sdk/SR5E1_MCTK-1.3.0/src/MotorControl/regular_conversion_manager.c ****  * It is continuously scheduled in HF task after current reading.
 468:.sdk/SR5E1_MCTK-1.3.0/src/MotorControl/regular_conversion_manager.c ****  *
 469:.sdk/SR5E1_MCTK-1.3.0/src/MotorControl/regular_conversion_manager.c ****  * This function remove the handle from the scheduling.
 470:.sdk/SR5E1_MCTK-1.3.0/src/MotorControl/regular_conversion_manager.c ****  *
 471:.sdk/SR5E1_MCTK-1.3.0/src/MotorControl/regular_conversion_manager.c ****  * @note Note that even though, in such configurations, regular conversions are
 472:.sdk/SR5E1_MCTK-1.3.0/src/MotorControl/regular_conversion_manager.c ****  *       continuously scheduled after having been requested once, the results of
 473:.sdk/SR5E1_MCTK-1.3.0/src/MotorControl/regular_conversion_manager.c ****  *       subsequent conversions are not made available unless the users invoke
 474:.sdk/SR5E1_MCTK-1.3.0/src/MotorControl/regular_conversion_manager.c ****  *       RCM_RequestUserConv() again.
 475:.sdk/SR5E1_MCTK-1.3.0/src/MotorControl/regular_conversion_manager.c ****  *
